// Sample "mem.image" for $init_jbus_model (open-source bench).
// Format: $readmemh-style ASCII hex words; "@<hexaddr>" sets the next
// word index (index = byte address >> 3, i.e. 64-bit word addressing).
// Replace with a real diag image for boot/DMA work.
@00000000
deadbeefcafebabe
0123456789abcdef
@00001000
55555555aaaaaaaa
